## 3. Starting point

| Item | State |
|---|---|
| `pom.xml` | Boot parent 4.1.2, Java 25. Dependencies: `starter-validation`, `starter-webmvc`, `starter-data-jpa`, `starter-actuator`, `postgresql` (runtime), `starter-flyway`, `flyway-database-postgresql`, `devtools`; tests: `starter-validation-test`, `starter-webmvc-test`. **No** security, Testcontainers, Modulith, Spotless, JaCoCo |
| `application.yml` | Single file. `.env` import, `DB_URL`/`DB_USER`/`DB_PASSWORD` placeholders, Hikari pool, `ddl-auto: validate` ✓, `open-in-view: false` ✓, `hibernate.jdbc.time_zone: UTC`, Flyway enabled, actuator `health,info`. **No profiles** |
| Migrations | `V1__initial_schema.sql`, `V2__auth_hardening.sql`, `V3__refresh_token_constraints.sql` (the TASKS.md exit criterion says `V1__baseline.sql`; that's out of date) |
| Java | `PaymentreconflowApplication.java` only |
| Tests | `PaymentreconflowApplicationTests.contextLoads()`, needs a live database (fails on a fresh clone unless M0 §4.7 pulled Testcontainers forward) |
| Docker | No `compose.yaml` |
| CI | None |

Tick M2.1 (done, using `spring-boot-starter-flyway` instead of `flyway-core`), M2.6 and M2.7 in TASKS.md.

